    narr:narration """The operational status of the [Kestrelwood spectrograph](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_3) was established on July 16, 2026, through a specific [frequency calibration](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_1) set at 88.4 MHz. This technical baseline is supported by [verification procedures](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_2) that cross-reference the instrument against established June reference plates, ensuring performance consistency across the full observing band. The session-level documentation [summarizes these findings](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_4) to codify the instrument's current readiness. Underlying these specific technical assertions is a [broader methodological commitment](narr:Narrative_InstrumentCalibrationVerifiedAgainstReferenceData) that posits calibration trust is contingent upon independent, dated verification across the entire operational range.""" ;
